  "question": {
    "text": "A&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;F</mi></math>&nbsp;capacitor is charged fully by a&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>220</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;supply. It is then disconnected from the supply and is connected in series to another uncharged&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;F</mi></math>&nbsp;capacitor. If the energy change during the charge redistribution is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>&nbsp;then value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math>&nbsp;to the nearest integer is :"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>220</mn><mi>Volt</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Heat loss;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mn>220</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>22</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>55</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>22</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1210</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1210</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>According to questions</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>so,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>"
  }
